      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Capstone: a symbolic chain makes the structure visible.\n\nIf output Q is proportional to workers W, hours H, days D and efficiency E, then Q ∝ WHDE.\n\nTo find one variable, keep Q fixed and the others become inverse to that target.",
